<title>ITALY: Deputy PM says Italy will meet 3pct EMU goal.</title>
<headline>Deputy PM says Italy will meet 3pct EMU goal.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Deputy Prime Minister Walter Veltroni said on Thursday the government was reducing its deficit and he was confident of reaching the three percent ratio of deficit to gross domestic product (GDP) required for EMU.</p>
</text>
